    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udfe8 About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eElectric Road\u300f is a strategy puzzle game where you transmit electricity from a power plant to a factory using tiles within a limited budget.<br>How you connect will affect your costs, and your choices will directly affect your results.<br>Design your own optimized power grid with challenges, efficiency, and smartness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd36 Game Features (Key Features)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple yet deep puzzle. The fun of finding the optimal solution through simple manipulation of connecting wires! The entire path changes depending on where you place the tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Budget Optimization &amp; 3-Star System Get more stars by solving problems with less! Supports multi-repeat content with repeated challenges to find the lowest cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Art of Strategic DeploymentAvoid obstacles, think about connection directions, and find the best solution with limited resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Who would you recommend this to?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle fans who love logical thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamers who like strategy elements like budgeting and optimization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light users who prefer short, focused gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udfe8 About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eElectric Road\u300f is a strategy puzzle game where you transmit electricity from a power plant to a factory using tiles within a limited budget.<br>How you connect will affect your costs, and your choices will directly affect your results.<br>Design your own optimized power grid with challenges, efficiency, and smartness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd36 Game Features (Key Features)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple yet deep puzzle. The fun of finding the optimal solution through simple manipulation of connecting wires! The entire path changes depending on where you place the tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Budget Optimization &amp; 3-Star System Get more stars by solving problems with less! Supports multi-repeat content with repeated challenges to find the lowest cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Art of Strategic DeploymentAvoid obstacles, think about connection directions, and find the best solution with limited resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Who would you recommend this to?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle fans who love logical thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamers who like strategy elements like budgeting and optimization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light users who prefer short, focused gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
